id":"07920291-e132-4491-bcc9-d51c9cd6eee5","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1f92-bc8f-4bc5-49df"},{"link_uuid":"bf327b91-f180-405d-9f9d-3fe2ecc11e7d","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"879c-b6f1-b3eb-4c34"},{"link_uuid":"7a2c0f10-09ad-4ede-b025-16b941ab5513","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"9a29-0e0f-16f0-408e"},{"link_uuid":"9f9bf27e-f395-46d8-b218-df273a1ebd68","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"5faf-9526-96f9-4624"},{"link_uuid":"ea2de654-cd10-441e-9e66-9918d1e1456f","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"9eca-a40d-03c0-47c0"},{"link_uuid":"59177f4e-8e15-41f3-a419-7fac3d1135af","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1196-de39-aa5b-41ca"},{"link_uuid":"a35a71e5-c0f4-40b7-8dc7-88ff8e9b9284","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"93ec-b64f-c9f3-4ac2"},{"link_uuid":"e44a343b-80a4-4b99-a50b-a870dcf51d56","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"3570-b794-b66d-4b6b"},{"link_uuid":"f7e256f0-af73-4e9d-b0f6-7db2a6df871f","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"537d-a891-b887-41d1"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_sync_narrow_refspec.py:1-21` — Preserve narrow-refspec synchronization. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_sync_union_recovery.py:1-21` — Preserve unrelated-history union recovery. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_tests_import_convention.py:1-16` — Preserve prohibition on namespace-dependent imports. Co